# UI reference: penny-edge-v2

When building or refining UI in Provita, treat **[penny-edge-v2](https://github.com/juanmartinzzz/penny-edge-v2)** as the primary interaction/UI inspiration source.

- Local clone lives at `repos/penny-edge-v2` (see `repos.json`). Browse it; do not `npm install` there.
- Prefer adapting patterns (cards, sections, motion, density, control shapes) into Provita's existing design system (`src/`, custom CSS) rather than copying files wholesale.
- Notable starting points: `repos/penny-edge-v2/src/components/interaction/` (e.g. `SectionsCard`).
- Refresh clones with `npm run repos:update`.
